msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/json/content-address.md:75
msgid "**Description:** This would be the content-address itself."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/json/content-address.md:77
msgid ""
"For all current methods, this is just a content address of the file system "
"object of the store object, [as described in the store chapter](../../store/"
"file-system-object/content-address.md), and not of the store object as a "
"whole. In particular, the references of the store object are _not_ taken "
"into account with this hash (and currently-supported methods)."
msgstr ""

